2	manual_mantenimiento_preventivo.pdf	2	1	1. Objetivo y alcance\nEste manual define las tareas y las frecuencias de mantenimiento preventivo de los equipos rotativos\ny electricos de la planta: bombas (codigos P-101 a P-110), motores (M-301 a M-310), compresores\n(C-201 a C-208), ventiladores (V-401 a V-406) y transformadores (T-501 a T-506).\nLas frecuencias indicadas son las de referencia para un equipo en servicio normal. Un equipo de\ncriticidad alta se inspecciona con la frecuencia indicada o con la mitad del intervalo, lo que resulte\nmas exigente. Los equipos de criticidad baja pueden extender el intervalo hasta un 25%, con\naprobacion del supervisor.\nToda tarea preventiva se registra como una orden de mantenimiento de tipo preventivo, con las\nhoras trabajadas y los repuestos utilizados.	[0.001576,-0.0331863,-0.0270393,-0.0100855,0.0208953,-0.0099129,0.0227126,0.0141578,0.0472675,-0.0870318,-0.0315446,-0.0144037,-0.0395309,0.0283129,0.0137097,-0.0002252,-0.0111069,0.0271726,0.0320645,-0.009226,-0.0215238,-0.0389927,0.0163145,-0.0373139,-0.0224246,0.0069426,0.0072332,-0.0403236,-0.0169959,0.1993308,-0.0361907,0.0168733,-0.0116128,-0.0137403,0.0130892,-0.023871,-0.0833975,-0.0183888,-0.0381872,0.0155271,-0.0670434,0.0401313,-0.0384924,0.0121086,0.0001613,-0.042891,-0.0340808,0.0526739,0.0484943,-0.0159567,0.0025306,0.0081347,-0.0131878,0.0282593,-0.0224866,0.0029017,0.0177977,-0.005919,0.0184816,0.0238389,0.0144098,0.0223085,0.0174652,-0.0038968,-0.0525483,-0.0245837,0.073791,0.0079822,-0.0271774,-0.0289447,0.0282593,-0.0217984,0.0107736,0.0371249,-0.034969,-0.0581719,-0.0714417,0.0502183,-0.000873,0.0489227,-0.0064867,-0.0190748,0.014506,-0.0435901,0.0279775,0.0423281,-0.0220335,-0.0392033,-0.003281,0.0172951,0.0280438,0.0423285,0.021306,-0.0005625,-0.0436177,-0.0113465,0.0284748,-0.0180671,0.02539,-0.0018017,-0.0138586,0.0049261,0.0482162,0.0145115,-0.0049193,-0.0230995,-0.0111811,0.0441541,0.0110869,-0.0065106,0.020513,-0.2852507,-0.0208144,0.0269405,-0.01