3	manual_mantenimiento_preventivo.pdf	3	1	2. Bombas centrifugas\nAplica a P-101 a P-110.\nTarea\nFrecuencia\nInspeccion visual de fugas en el sello mecanico\nMensual\nLubricacion de rodamientos con grasa NLGI 2\nCada 3 meses\nVerificacion de alineacion bomba-motor\nCada 6 meses\nRevision del sello mecanico y cambio si hay desgaste\nAnual\nLimpieza de filtros de succion\nCada 2 meses\nSi se detecta una fuga continua en el sello, la bomba pasa a estado en mantenimiento y se abre una\norden correctiva de prioridad media. La alineacion fuera de tolerancia es la causa mas frecuente de\nvibracion elevada en bombas.	[0.0172174,-0.0404253,-0.0165766,0.0086299,0.0369883,-0.0308963,0.0177178,0.00269,0.0218191,-0.0564987,-0.0198347,-0.0075772,-0.0125018,0.0092617,0.0084474,0.0506192,0.0206875,0.0214923,0.0146191,0.0151275,0.0141773,-0.0200759,0.0291906,-0.0367024,-0.0432378,0.0102113,0.0124592,-0.0526236,0.0062264,0.1744384,-0.0110904,0.0159802,-0.0367244,-0.0450353,0.0051869,-0.0232697,-0.0584346,-0.0124852,-0.0534579,0.0056959,-0.0491615,0.0572179,-0.0376478,0.0096233,-0.0071888,-0.0317423,-0.0245946,0.0365113,0.0452871,0.0052977,0.0109896,0.0101143,-0.0313276,0.0649677,-0.0230852,0.0043292,-0.0221041,0.0195682,0.0104323,0.0358525,-0.0008565,0.0068257,0.0363039,0.0362428,-0.022028,0.0080372,0.0627869,-0.0050737,0.0134481,-0.0259421,0.0152716,-0.0175747,0.0067842,0.0257692,-0.0038591,-0.0433833,-0.0338369,0.0275041,0.0021596,0.0956992,-0.0077322,-0.0165032,0.0500509,-0.0482442,0.030445,0.0155087,-0.0101209,-0.0255977,0.0017145,-0.0001651,0.0086347,0.0602682,0.008645,-0.006797,-0.0251907,-0.0143796,0.0480753,0.0491071,0.0199722,0.0274589,0.0095857,0.0169728,0.0384888,0.0194917,-0.0295854,-0.0161426,-0.0313104,0.0294539,-0.0128501,-0.0102237,0.0221891,-0.2750743,-0.0165761,0.0285075,-0.0009355,0.1077159,0.0358699,-0.0036828,0.022714,0.0088581,-0.0018623,0.0154435,-0.0277796,-0.0378067,0.01637,-0.0107535,0.0153309,0.0237693,-0.013343,0.0349464,-0.0145871,-0.0289956,0.0358281,-0.