10	politica_gestion_ordenes.pdf	4	1	3. Bloqueo y etiquetado antes de intervenir\nNingun equipo se interviene sin aplicar el procedimiento de bloqueo y etiquetado. Los pasos son:\n Avisar al operador del area y al supervisor.\n Detener el equipo por su parada normal.\n Aislar todas las fuentes de energia electrica, neumatica e hidraulica.\n Colocar el candado personal y la etiqueta con nombre y fecha.\n Liberar la energia residual y verificar la ausencia de energia antes de comenzar.\n Al terminar, retirar solo el candado propio y avisar al operador antes de reenergizar.\nLos elementos de proteccion personal minimos son casco, anteojos de seguridad, guantes y calzado\nde seguridad. Para trabajos en transformadores se agregan guantes dielectricos y proteccion facial.	[-0.0186837,-0.027155,0.0377148,-0.0450749,0.0037349,-0.0194953,0.0129928,0.0071562,0.0461606,-0.0353703,0.0085457,-0.0211141,-0.0114084,0.0263604,-0.0079017,0.0027317,0.0355626,-0.0150508,0.019233,0.0230662,0.0227772,-0.0046315,-0.0154468,-0.0413287,-0.0523635,0.0043175,-0.0094641,-0.0435334,0.0057665,0.1979221,-0.0092241,0.0201345,-0.0149685,-0.027723,-0.0197896,-0.0384132,-0.0310618,0.027457,-0.0188953,-0.0176354,-0.0289742,-0.010716,-0.012285,0.0319465,-0.0142688,0.0083297,-0.0067361,-0.0029381,0.064958,-0.0158345,0.0342066,0.0150174,-0.0008648,0.0168279,-0.0174442,-0.009159,0.0009668,0.0399984,0.0386175,0.057667,0.0145264,0.0079262,-0.0145736,-0.0356562,-0.0376889,0.0112748,0.0768529,0.0163288,-0.0067547,-0.0128683,0.0463014,0.0053943,0.0289872,0.0285571,-0.0179059,0.0219931,-0.0665387,0.0521692,-0.0385926,0.057719,0.0071918,-0.054007,0.0358995,-0.0243343,0.002812,0.0270293,-0.0051044,0.0070481,-0.0372273,0.0297297,-0.006801,0.0501366,0.0002053,-0.029867,-0.0031107,-0.0127786,0.0289681,0.0110308,-0.0173879,-0.0086498,0.0269283,0.0073307,0.0293462,0.0509263,-0.0017413,-0.0084605,-0.0667745,0.0080542,0.0336476,-0.0204127,-0.001264,-0.2859339,-0.005622,0.0187613,-0.0152909,0.0970398,0.049647,-0.00