11	politica_gestion_ordenes.pdf	5	1	4. Cierre de una orden\nUna orden solo puede pasar a estado cerrada cuando incluye:\n La descripcion del trabajo realizado y la causa encontrada.\n Las horas trabajadas.\n Los repuestos utilizados, si los hubo.\n La confirmacion del operador de que el equipo funciona con normalidad.\nLas ordenes correctivas originadas por una alarma se cierran solo despues de que la alarma haya\nterminado. Las ordenes que superan el plazo de su prioridad sin iniciarse se informan en la reunion\nsemanal de mantenimiento.	[0.0215902,-0.0178891,-0.0047797,-0.0466903,-0.0070282,0.0317476,0.029209,0.0087988,0.0181368,-0.0510317,0.0188483,0.006763,0.0005056,-0.0020768,0.0083241,-0.0309585,0.0230749,-0.0263187,-0.0022628,0.0014553,0.0328567,0.0039437,-0.0173928,-0.0201558,-0.0204701,0.0061903,-0.0137856,-0.0387031,0.0187983,0.1996551,-0.0026884,0.0019972,-0.0397439,-0.0139494,0.0057175,-0.0182583,-0.0332557,0.0323914,0.0078476,0.0027517,-0.0430795,0.0292997,-0.0225533,0.0346485,-0.0196301,-0.0125329,-0.0392238,4.22e-05,0.0284344,-0.0410534,0.0542704,0.0371972,-0.0379702,0.0452423,0.0076184,-0.034604,-0.0108192,0.0436552,0.0401809,-0.0081667,-0.0178227,0.0204979,0.0060779,-0.0226846,-0.0334756,-0.001777,0.0723763,-0.0007347,-0.0260179,0.0082196,0.0286382,-0.0038467,0.0158087,-0.0033836,-0.0181187,0.0181648,-0.0640728,0.0527345,-0.0216207,0.0260759,-0.002094,-0.0406639,-0.0254518,-0.012366,-0.024517,0.0584706,-0.0283021,0.0006531,-0.0128097,0.0270602,-0.0199025,0.0205253,-0.0075612,-0.0175779,-0.0503263,-0.0150945,0.0329414,0.0076569,-0.0377964,-0.004682,0.0032773,0.0057746,-0.003759,0.0529942,-0.0046152,-0.0321695,-0.0216236,-0.004654,0.0129865,-0.033961,0.0122292,-0.299424,0.0016087,0.0325665,-0.0076535,0.0828837,0.0494447,0.0249321,0.0008435,0.0322234,-0.0120831,0.0001273,-0.024912,-0.0465679,-0.0055507,0.0180707,0.047141,-0.0145133,-0.0215748,0.0154082,0.0286569,-0.014807,0.0283092,0.0357275,-0.0108911,-0.0080958,-0.0109989,-0.0005808,-0.0097997,-0