14	procedimiento_respuesta_alarmas.pdf	3	1	2. Alarmas de vibracion\nLos umbrales de referencia son 4,5 mm/s de alerta y 7,1 mm/s critico para bombas, motores y\nventiladores, y 5,6 mm/s de alerta y 9,0 mm/s critico para compresores.\nAlarma de alerta:\n Confirmar la lectura con un segundo instrumento portatil.\n Inspeccionar fijaciones, base y acoples.\n Programar la verificacion de alineacion y del estado de los rodamientos dentro de las 24 horas.\nAlarma critica:\n Reducir la carga del equipo de inmediato y avisar al supervisor.\n Inspeccionar rodamientos, alineacion, desbalance y aflojamiento mecanico.\n Si la vibracion no baja del umbral critico en 30 minutos, detener el equipo mediante el\nprocedimiento de bloqueo y etiquetado.\n Abrir una orden correctiva de prioridad alta y asignar un tecnico de especialidad mecanica.\nEn compresores como el C-201, una vibracion critica sostenida obliga ademas a revisar el acople y	[0.0122784,-0.0277014,-0.0038289,-0.0081399,0.0126734,-0.0152735,-0.0175371,0.0038828,0.0174262,-0.05693,-0.0221284,0.0200263,0.0208562,-0.0161448,0.0245462,0.0072243,0.0198117,-0.0024175,0.029781,-0.004506,0.0211566,-0.017779,-0.0061146,-0.0203712,-0.0432712,0.0334435,0.0299956,-0.0047712,0.0181335,0.1799358,-0.0534481,0.0150555,-0.0526551,-0.0302182,0.0087787,-0.0559463,-0.041989,-0.0231583,-0.0273313,-0.000828,-0.0371725,0.0193151,-0.0298055,0.0052061,-0.0014763,-0.0296797,-0.0418494,0.0115007,0.0276199,-0.0076767,0.000344,0.013424,-0.0158723,0.0552407,-0.0084055,0.0289676,0.0278576,0.060216,0.035565,0.0318075,0.0018179,0.0414981,0.0234889,0.0194832,0.0132895,-0.0161149,0.0910865,-0.0197341,-0.0029556,-0.0110216,-0.0004768,-0.0130582,-0.0017594,0.0076561,0.0205223,-0.0244905,-0.0372457,0.0328444,-0.0392069,0.0224865,0.0582228,-0.0760365,-0.0256959,-0.0282333,0.0028264,0.0569829,-0.029923,-0.0397241,-0.008882,0.0172159,0.0238353,0.043441,0.0240577,0.022585,-0.0401475,-0.0207003,0.032648,0.0178362,-0.001965,0.0044718,0.0183866,0.0319946,0.0