16	procedimiento_respuesta_alarmas.pdf	4	1	3. Alarmas de temperatura\nLos umbrales de referencia son 80 a 85 grados C de alerta y 15 grados mas para el critico en\nmotores, bombas y compresores. Los transformadores tienen 85 grados C de alerta y 105 grados C\ncritico.\nAlarma de alerta:\n Verificar la ventilacion y que las rejillas esten libres.\n Revisar el nivel y el estado de la lubricacion.\n Medir la corriente para descartar sobrecarga.\nAlarma critica:\n Reducir la carga y revisar la causa del calentamiento.\n En un motor, si la temperatura no baja en 30 minutos, detenerlo para evitar dano del bobinado.\n En un transformador, avisar al supervisor electrico y no volver a cargarlo hasta una inspeccion\ntermografica.\n Asignar un tecnico de especialidad lubricacion o electrica segun la causa.	[0.0200178,-0.029731,0.0167286,-0.019167,0.021021,-0.0071005,0.0088089,-0.0084518,0.0163109,-0.0570717,-0.0133518,0.0185656,0.0037047,0.0123986,0.0021595,-0.0213632,0.0308758,-0.0003563,0.0279176,0.0088077,0.007035,-0.0362417,0.0145063,-0.0087076,-0.02352,0.0205693,0.01375,-0.0218346,0.0218875,0.1767132,-0.071839,-0.0150433,-0.0397431,-0.0270272,0.0084667,-0.0457345,-0.0026899,-0.0007392,-0.0171878,-0.0080317,-0.0434503,0.0314676,-0.0114826,0.0045988,-0.017662,-0.0208753,-0.0598114,0.0278396,0.0469952,-0.0310064,-0.0002522,-0.0073381,-0.0065149,0.0559704,0.0063203,0.029999,0.0146687,0.0600678,0.0308945,0.0438224,-0.0264076,0.01879,0.0205289,0.0192606,0.0013809,-0.0107306,0.0754753,0.0228812,0.012035,0.012099,0.0326265,0.0020229,-0.0035601,0.0170538,-0.0200831,-0.0405159,-0.0313561,0.0423101,-0.0414366,0.0078144,0.0321975,-0.042428,-0.033997,-0.0085727,0.04353,0.0598359,-0.0258762,-0.025673,0.0016287,0.0213136,0.0160846,0.0349681,0.0070563,-0.0010802,-0.0075224,-0.0528676,0.0149926,-0.0032798,-0.0002276,0.0161977,-0.0051219,0.0529995,0.0263677,0.0015752,-0.0132478,0.0001714,-0.0134397,0.0244975,-0.0106119,-0.0100139,-0.0110962,-0.3032588,0.0270286,0.0273177,-0.0127178,