17	procedimiento_respuesta_alarmas.pdf	5	1	4. Alarmas de presion y de corriente\nPresion. Los umbrales son 8,0 bar de alerta y 10,0 bar critico en bombas, y 8,5 bar de alerta y 10,5\nbar critico en compresores.\n Alerta: revisar filtros, valvulas y el estado de los sellos.\n Critica: aliviar la presion por la valvula de seguridad, detener la fuente de presion y abrir una\norden de prioridad alta con un tecnico de instrumentacion.\nCorriente. El umbral critico es 1,2 veces el umbral de alerta del sensor.\n Alerta: comparar con la corriente de placa y revisar la carga mecanica.\n Critica: reducir la carga, revisar conexiones y bornes, y abrir una orden de prioridad alta con un\ntecnico electrico.	[0.0109147,-0.03991,0.0247509,-0.0218998,0.0226855,-0.0265789,0.0102573,-0.0100954,0.0010037,-0.0731709,-0.0253265,0.0042524,0.0167164,-0.020125,0.0082793,-0.0034823,0.0291209,-0.0107061,0.0113271,-0.0003543,0.0367449,-0.0267498,-0.0122781,-0.0225342,-0.0132551,-0.0026948,-0.0020219,-0.0357602,-0.0046474,0.1871119,-0.0288907,-0.0094354,-0.0484959,-0.020486,0.0261139,-0.0353,-0.0178577,0.0071192,-0.0124736,-0.020432,-0.0503192,0.0021726,-0.0121177,0.0298885,-0.0205243,-0.0164208,-0.0454852,0.0342611,0.0277103,-0.0186293,0.0066372,0.0034193,-0.006637,0.0491143,-0.0214085,0.0075096,-0.0048807,0.0462279,0.0469546,0.0552725,-0.0059905,0.0265105,-0.0111227,0.0242029,0.0011342,0.0013628,0.0776316,-0.0025254,0.0036071,0.0100912,0.0018105,0.0233585,-0.0072674,-0.0151506,-0.00414,-0.0194731,-0.0414868,0.0331372,-0.0325446,0.0276729,0.0333059,-0.0553796,-0.0282662,-0.0156908,0.0071791,0.0605729,-0.0178272,-0.029636,0.0044002,0.0121372,0.0127728,0.0410247,0.0009394,0.0340316,-0.0100359,-0.0160234,0.0270284,0.0077221,-0.0106842,0.0114165,0.0156399,0.0202214,0.0045548,0.0304642,-0.0175825,0.0231001,-0.0014478,0.0390984,-0.0208888,-0.0133019,-0.0015128,-0.2801796,0.0042195,0.0095766,0.0047935,0.1013077,0.0213795,-0.0140632,0.0593968,-0.0223893,-0.0088515,0.0205009,-0.0277742,-0.0356484,